// MechScape map: the Scrapyard. Format notes are in README.md (Maps) and at
// the top of tests/maps/test_yard.map. Generated once from a script, then
// edited by hand; it's the source of truth now. Regions, west to east:
//   The Commons (x 0-21): the hab (the crew's quarters and workshop, a safe
//     zone with a build zone inside), the mech gantry and its pad, the
//     foreman, the Deadfields gate, and the survey elevator (at the south fence, up
//     the cliff to the Quiet Reach) with the surveyor.
//   Camp (fenced): spawn, benches, storage locker, the manufactory, and the
//     scrap artist.
//   Drone field south-west of camp; the long wall with three gaps; sentry
//     ruins east of the middle gap, with the hatch down to the Undercroft.
//   Loader yard, north-east, raised a level, ramps at its west and south gates.
//   Seep flats north of camp; the Pit (a level down) south of the ruins; the
//     vent basin (a level down) in the far south-east.
// Heights: 0-9 flat levels, a-i ramps between (a joins 0 and 1).

name: Scrapyard
ground: dirt
zone safe: 2,2 17,15
zone hab: 3,3 16,14
zone build: 3,6 16,14
zone pad: 8,21 9,22

